OL,3,GNEWSAPrisoners' artwork goes on display
OL,4,Aat cathedral
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtwork from prisoners inside HMP
OL,7,FColdingley in Surrey is being exhibited
OL,8,Fat Guildford Cathedral.
OL,10,FThe free exhibition, called
OL,11,FTransformations, started on Tuesday and
OL,12,Fwas due to run until 19 October.
OL,14,FThe Very Reverend Bob Cooper, Dean of
OL,15,FGuildford, said: "The Transformations
OL,16,Fexhibition reminds us that every person
OL,17,Fhas inherent dignity and the capacity
OL,18,Ffor change.
OL,20,F"Art has a remarkable ability to open
OL,21,Fconversations, encourage reflection and
OL,22,Finspire hope."
